              "designSystem": {
                "displayName": "CourtPass",
                "styleGuidelines": "## Brand & Style\nThe design system is anchored in a high-performance, athletic aesthetic tailored for the premium padel scene in Sheikh Zayed. It utilizes a **Modern Minimalist** style with **Tactile Athletic** influences, mirroring the physical environment of the sport—specifically the contrast between lush green courts and clay surfaces. \n\nThe UI prioritizes speed and clarity, evoking a sense of professional coordination and energy. By balancing generous whitespace with high-contrast functional elements, the design system ensures that the booking experience feels as precise and fluid as the game itself.\n\n## Layout & Spacing\nThe layout follows a **Fixed-Fluid** hybrid model optimized for a 390px mobile viewport. \n\nThe structure relies on a consistent 20px horizontal safe-area margin. Internal components use a modular 4px base grid. Content is organized in vertical stacks with 16px (Medium) or 24px (Large) spacing between logical sections. A sticky header provides constant access to navigation, while primary actions are strictly anchored to the bottom of the viewport or span the full width of the content area for ease of thumb-reach.\n\n## Elevation & Depth\nThe design system employs **Tonal Layering** with minimal shadow usage to maintain a clean, modern look. \n\nDepth is primarily communicated through color shifts: the `#F4F7F5` background acts as the lowest layer, while `#FFFFFF` white cards sit on top. When elevation is necessary for interactive elements (like a floating booking button), use an **Ambient Shadow**: a very soft, highly diffused 10% opacity shadow with a slight green tint (`#0F1A14`) to prevent the shadow from appearing muddy.\n\n## Components\n- **Buttons:** Primary buttons are full-width, 56px height, using `#1B7A4E` background and white text. Secondary buttons use a transparent background with a 1.5px border of the primary color.\n- **Cards:** White background with 12px padding. Use a subtle 1px border (`#E0E5E2`) instead of shadows to define court listings.\n- **Chips:** Used for time slots. Default state is white with a grey border; active state is Primary Green with white text.\n- **Input Fields:** 48px height, 12px radius, with a subtle `#F4F7F5` fill to distinguish from the card surface.\n- **Promo Banners:** Utilize the `#FDE8DC` peach background with `#E86A2A` orange accents to draw attention to special offers or new club openings.\n- **Status Indicators:** Use `#E86A2A` for \"Available Soon\" and `#1B7A4E` for \"Instant Book.\"",
